>Maria</surname><given-names>RF M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Plumbagine: a pharmacological approach</article-title><source>Floresta e Ambiente</source><year>2003</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>98</fpage><lpage>105</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>